  "title": "Pumpkin Cream Cheese Muffins",
  "description": "These pumpkin cream cheese muffins feature a rich, sweet filling and a buttery cinnamon and pecan streusel topping for an irresistible fall treat.",
  "authors": [
    "Barb"
  ],
  "date_published": "2008-06-30T19:10:59-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2023-10-03T17:42:55-04:00",
  "prep_time": "PT20M",
  "cook_time": "PT20M",
  "total_time": "PT40M",
  "yield": [
    "18",
    "18 muffins"
  ],
  "categories": [
    "Snack",
    "Breakfast"
  ],
  "cuisines": [
    "American"
  ],
  "regions": [
    "American"
  ],
  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [
    "publisher-tested"
  ],
  "ingredients": [
    "1 (8 ounce) package cream cheese",
    "1 large egg",
    "3 tablespoons brown sugar",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "5 tablespoons white sugar",
    "4.5 tablespoons all-purpose flour",
    "3 tablespoons chopped pecans",
    "0.75 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "3 tablespoons cold butter, cubed",
    "2.5 cups all-purpose flour",
    "2 cups white sugar",
    "2 teaspoons baking powder",
    "2 teaspoons ground cinnamon",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "1.3333333730698 cups canned pumpkin",
    "2 large eggs",
    "0.33333334326744 cup olive oil",
    "2 teaspoons vanilla extract"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Nh21yEdYuCHGv1WrVKV2BkgQoJg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8458-PumpkinCreamCheeseMuffins-ddmfs-Step1-3x4-8089-f0670718893e46b7978c6b1ad211d8f4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8458/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Grease and flour 18 muffin cups or use paper liners.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-1ejQOTm6QWR8tfjAAbJ1_AzToY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8458-PumpkinCreamCheeseMuffins-ddmfs-Step2-3x4-8092-f3302646835b495697b15651409e1e96.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8458/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the filling: Beat cream cheese in a medium bowl with an electric mixer until soft.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vEd7ctA4gcFlzMZYb7ZAwdZHHPM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8458-PumpkinCreamCheeseMuffins-ddmfs-Step3-3x4-8094-d870891e72134215814a74d1ba81f94e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8458/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add egg, brown sugar, and vanilla; beat until smooth. Set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/W-wEBGDHXQCpG5dFJnwRFl5xOAU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8458-PumpkinCreamCheeseMuffins-ddmfs-Step4-3x4-8096-ddc14c46cdd44197be073288976e41f6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8458/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the streusel: Mix together sugar, flour, pecans, and cinnamon until combined. Cut in butter with a fork until crumbly. Set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Kur2DvmjHYqZN4m47ctTT1ibGbU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8458-PumpkinCreamCheeseMuffins-ddmfs-Step5-3x4-8097-ae3a83699a534b89afa0fae598e682e2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8458/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the muffins: Sift together flour, sugar, baking powder, cinnamon, and salt in a large bowl; form a well in the center.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7uL1skBUwhYhMyo2OBh0yTu8-f4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8458-PumpkinCreamCheeseMuffins-ddmfs-Step6-3x4-8098-07eeb681a0ac45e49dc8f23f7a2ffd7f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8458/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add pumpkin, eggs, olive oil, and vanilla to the well; beat until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vDg6a3AFWnM47xRH7s3HSQS1KQk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8458-PumpkinCreamCheeseMuffins-ddmfs-Step7-3x4-8101-a8b88a939066435997901ea822497931.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8458/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour batter into the prepared muffin cups, about 1/2 full.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pKNSORdKMcJJnIgbVn9tyhU3wwA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8458-PumpkinCreamCheeseMuffins-ddmfs-Step8-3x4-8102-b0e0f4356eb24f19ac841b2b77328f64.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8458/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drop 1 tablespoon filling over batter in each muffin cup. Press down gently; do not let filling touch the bottom of the muffin cup.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/oRjYM7bm4b8XRl_4B7u20cphpFA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8458-PumpkinCreamCheeseMuffins-ddmfs-Step8-3x4-8104-e68ff2be16de4c9289d520b645d33ce3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8458/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle with streusel.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WgWwTCLvw1xmJjszxNX3b-2AKbQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8458-PumpkinCreamCheeseMuffins-ddmfs-Step9-3x4-8109-2139782c7e3540608004a8357490c565.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8458/step_10.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into the center of a muffin comes out clean, 20 to 25 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/u3vKjtxaAXt7gGLnitrk6qeRTXM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8458-PumpkinCreamCheeseMuffins-ddmfs-3x4-8167-96311b333c104f6fa3eb13b98eade530.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8458/step_11.webp"
    }
  ],
